This is an independent evaluation-results repository, not an official release
from the Astra or DexJoCo teams.

The simulator and benchmark were developed by the DexJoCo contributors:
https://github.com/brave-eai/dexjoco

Training demonstrations came from the official DexJoCo dataset:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/DexJoCo/DexJoCo-Datasets-LeRobot

Reference policy scores are attributed to Table 2 of the DexJoCo paper:
https://arxiv.org/html/2605.16257v1#S4.T2

The included videos are recorded outputs of the evaluated DexJoCo simulation.
Simulator assets and training data are not redistributed in this repository.
Third-party software and assets retain their original notices and terms.
The repository's MIT license applies to its original code and documentation.
